warning[bool_comparison]: comparing a bool with `true`: `ready == true`
  --> tests/lint/bool_comparison/bad.jai:9:8
   |
 9 |     if ready == true print("ready\n");
   |        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
help: write `ready`
   |
 8       ready := is_ready();
 9 ~     if ready print("ready\n");
10       if ready != false print("still ready\n");
   |
   = note: `bool_comparison` is `warn` by default
   = note: see https://jacket.matteopolak.com/lint-rules/bool_comparison

warning[bool_comparison]: comparing a bool with `false`: `ready != false`
  --> tests/lint/bool_comparison/bad.jai:10:8
   |
10 |     if ready != false print("still ready\n");
   |        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
help: write `ready`
   |
 9       if ready == true print("ready\n");
10 ~     if ready print("still ready\n");
11       if false == ready print("not ready\n");
   |
   = note: `bool_comparison` is `warn` by default
   = note: see https://jacket.matteopolak.com/lint-rules/bool_comparison

warning[bool_comparison]: comparing a bool with `false`: `false == ready`
  --> tests/lint/bool_comparison/bad.jai:11:8
   |
11 |     if false == ready print("not ready\n");
   |        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
help: write `!ready`
   |
10       if ready != false print("still ready\n");
11 ~     if !ready print("not ready\n");
12
   |
   = note: `bool_comparison` is `warn` by default
   = note: see https://jacket.matteopolak.com/lint-rules/bool_comparison

