warning[bool_comparison]: comparing a bool with `false`: `(a < b) == false`
  --> tests/lint/bool_comparison/bad.jai:16:9
   |
16 |     if (a < b) == false print("not less\n");
   |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
help: write `!(a < b)`
   |
15
16 ~     if !(a < b) print("not less\n");
17       if (a < b) == true print("less\n");
   |
   = note: `bool_comparison` is `warn` by default
   = note: see https://jacket.matteopolak.com/lint-rules/bool_comparison

warning[bool_comparison]: comparing a bool with `true`: `(a < b) == true`
  --> tests/lint/bool_comparison/bad.jai:17:9
   |
17 |     if (a < b) == true print("less\n");
   |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
help: write `(a < b)`
   |
16       if (a < b) == false print("not less\n");
17 ~     if (a < b) print("less\n");
18
   |
   = note: `bool_comparison` is `warn` by default
